 Pre-Writing Readiness Work Samples: Baseline vs. end-of-year comparisons of pencil grip position and control during line and shape tracing tasks.
 
 Quantitative goal: At least 85% of students will achieve age-appropriate mastery across all three evaluation rubrics by the end of the school year.","Campus Occupational Therapist (OT): Provides consultation on station setup, adaptive tool selection, and staff training for correct finger positioning and posture strategies.
 
